Instances of the traveling salesperson problem: the number of the cities,
then the coordinates x and y of each in the unit square
[see TravelingSalesman::read_cities() in
include/PBeFS/astar/TravelingSalesman.h].

tsp_40_0 to tsp_40_9
           the first 10 files of tsp/40_cities of
           https://github.com/jinnaiyuu/combinatorial_instances, 40 random
           cities each; AStarBench --size n keeps the first n.

